ets 10:50pm (America/Chicago) (exit code: 1) | a single failure is usually transient session-end contention (retries exhausted) — check scripts/flush.log; only if it repeats across sessions suspect bundled-CLI version skew — fix: cd ~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler && uv lock --upgrade-package claude-agent-sdk && uv sync\\r\\n[2026-09-28T01:46:39.522Z] memsearch-sync: index ETIMEDOUT 16x consecutively — indexing may not be keeping up: spawnSync memsearch ETIMEDOUT\\n[2026-09-28T01:46:48.843785+00:00] compiler-flush-failed: memory-compiler flush failed (session 0dde9ca1-7cb6-4b07-81c5-6d01ecc51462): FLUSH_ERROR: ResultError: Claude Code returned an error result: You've hit your session limit · resets 10:50pm (America/Chicago) (exit code: 1) | a single failure is usually transient session-end contention (retries exhausted) — check scripts/flush.log; only if it repeats across sessions suspect bundled-CLI version skew — fix: cd ~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler && uv lock --upgrade-package claude-agent-sdk && uv sync\\r\\n[2026-09-28T01:56:45.029Z] memsearch-sync: index ETIMEDOUT 17x consecutively — indexing may not be keeping up: spawnSync memsearch ETIMEDOUT\\n[2026-09-28T01:56:48.403330+00:00] compiler-flush-failed: memory-compiler flush failed (session e80f202a-f82b-490e-bfd0-1626da347fe8): FLUSH_ERROR: ResultError: Claude Code returned an error result: You've hit your session limit · resets 10:50pm (America/Chicago) (exit code: 1) | a single failure is usually transient session-end contention (retries exhausted) — check scripts/flush.log; only if it repeats across sessions suspect bundled-CLI version skew — fix: cd ~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler && uv lock --upgrade-package claude-agent-sdk && uv sync\\r\\n[2026-09-28T02:06:46.836Z] memsearch-sync: index ETIMEDOUT 18x consecutively — indexing may not be keeping up: spawnSync memsearch ETIMEDOUT\\n[2026-09-28T02:06:57.040092+00:00] compiler-flush-failed: memory-compiler flush failed (session 9506cda4-c4b9-400e-8a42