nd for the answer key.\n\nMethod notes:\n- All documents were fetched by Drive id with `gws`, one method for every root.\n- There is no Anthropic API key on this machine. Haiku runs through headless\n  `claude -p --model claude-haiku-4-5`, one call per file with the same state and the same\n  forced topic.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1568f3c3-fd69-4712-a947-e6441784ebd7","session_id":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\TypeSafe_Sandbox\\.claude\\worktrees\\drive-triage-run","sessionId":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"worktree-drive-triage-run"}
