orce your spouse, interview 200 ‘replacement’ candidates, put them through a battery of psychological tests, have follow-up interviews conducted by your closest friends, spend three years dating the most compatible ones, and then another 40 days praying and fasting about which one to choose, you’d still end up with a spouse who disappoints you.” The point is, we’re all human. Nobody’s perfect. WHY EVERY COUPLE HAS A CHANCE AT TRADING PLACES Only narcissists and deviants with no conscience are not capable of empat\r\n\r\n"}],"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c38743e9-831a-4e0d-931f-e27c82def385","session_id":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\TypeSafe_Sandbox\\.claude\\worktrees\\drive-triage-run","sessionId":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"worktree-drive-triage-run"}
