{"parentUuid":"df3523d6-1671-428e-a159-d60dc3eb2dd0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfW3BZhm7KzCbsZKXktfR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Haiku has finished all 200 files, so the Jev pilot is scored against every pre-registered bar.\n\n**Jev fails the pilot, on the accuracy bar only.** Its confident answers had the right domain on 127 of 166 files (76.5%), against a 90% bar. It passed the other two bars: it was confident on 83% of files, and it beat Haiku on its confident answers, 127 to 108.\n\n**Jev beat Haiku on every measure.** On all 200 files it got the domain right on 74.5% versus Haiku's 66%, and the topic right on 63.5% versus 52%. The prereg says that on a fail \"the best comparator does the pass\", but that rule assumed a comparator would beat Jev, and none has. That makes it your call, not mine. I'll bring it up once Codex finishes (177 files, about 2.7 hours, running alone now).\n\nThe results are committed and pushed (`fbc50ce`).\n\nRound 1 is above, whenever you're ready."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1060,"cache_read_input_tokens":154621,"output_tokens":322,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1060,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":322,"cache_read_input_tokens":154621,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1060,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1060},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfW3BZB15fB9xUkXjbVZw","type":"assistant","uuid":"dc2edf9c-73d6-48d0-afca-19bfaa06483d","timestamp":"2026-09-28T15: