{"parentUuid":"ca297251-9c50-4986-acc9-83645f0fcd72","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"SessionStart:resume","toolUseID":"69298d17-10a3-4efc-9626-c6db286113f2","hookEvent":"SessionStart","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\": {\"hookEventName\": \"SessionStart\", \"additionalContext\": \"## Today\\nMonday, September 28, 2026\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Knowledge Base\\n\\n178 compiled articles (137 concepts, 41 connections, 0 qa). The index is NOT loaded here \\u2014 read it only when a question actually needs it:\\n- Full index (article, summary, sources, updated): `C:\\\\Users\\\\eric_rash\\\\.claude\\\\claude-memory-compiler\\\\knowledge\\\\index.md`\\n- Article bodies: `C:\\\\Users\\\\eric_rash\\\\.claude\\\\claude-memory-compiler\\\\knowledge/<folder>/<name>.md`\\n- Search across all memory instead of reading the index: `memsearch search \\\"<query>\\\" --top-k 5`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Recent Daily Log\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:54)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:54)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:55)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:56)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:56)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:57)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\\n### Memory Flush (10:58)\\n\\nFLUSH_OK - Nothing worth saving from this session\\n\"}}\r\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"Loading knowledge base...","durationMs":4236},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f506d447-5c35-430d-8e60-70bb4831045f","timestamp":"2026-09-28T16:08:53.055Z","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\Flint\\.claude\\worktrees\\step1-triage","sessionId":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","version"