{"parentUuid":"e78a5e6d-e46f-49d5-95fe-b1a3bf729285","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWEzrZNJwJpoaj6eLHrH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1976,"cache_read_input_tokens":176356,"output_tokens":876,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":121},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1976,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":876,"cache_read_input_tokens":176356,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1976,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1976},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfWEzr3rGfJc6AYgH6RYb","type":"assistant","uuid":"0406e54f-7444-43cb-bbc1-2a11b2541f6c","timestamp":"2026-09-28T17:36:21.098Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\Flint\\.claude\\worktrees\\step1-triage","sessionId":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"step1-triage"}
{"parentUuid":"0406e54f-7444-43cb-bbc1-2a11b2541f6c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWEzrZNJwJpoaj6eLHrH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Round 3 is saved and pushed (`dd1d4af`).\n\nYour answers settle two contested items and change a third:\n- **Speed fades first, per Issurin.** Your Class 4 slide said the opposite, so the synthesis now records your position.\n- **Hard work ends 72 hours before kickoff, not 48.** The peaking synthesis inferred 48 hours, so its bottom line 2 gets corrected to your actual week.\n- **You use the dynamic strength index, not the SJ-CMJ gap.** DSI (CMJ against IMTP peak force) has its own evidence base, so it needs a separate check before a synthesis cites it.\n\n---\n\n### Round 4 of 4: the last 9\n\nThe rest is short, so I merged the last two rounds.\n\n**22. Return to play, integrated.** How do wellness surveys, targeted NordBord and ForceFrame isometrics combine into one readiness decision? Or does your LE/UE template already answer that?\n\n**23. Recovery and sleep.** Since the daily wellness surveys were dropped, is anything objective in use (HRV, sleep tracking)? Or is recovery handled through training-load design alone?\n\n**24. Nutrition.** Does any force-plate or GPS data flow to Performance Nutrition's body-composition or fueling decisions?\n\n**25. Coaching approach.** Do you personally use constraints-led or external-cue coaching, or is that reference material you don't apply the same way?\n\n**26. The five expectations** (Golden Rule, Be Disciplined, Be Relentless, Communicate, No Excuses). Is there a situation where you'd deliberately relax one?\n\n**27. Credit and ownership.** When an outside framework (Old Bull, SCN) meets your \"we/our, not me/my\" model, how do you handle attribution with staff, especially new staff or staff on loan from another unit?\n\n**28. Coach-facing reports.** What does a weekly or monthly report to coaches look like today, and who builds it?\n\n**29. TMG (tensiomyography).** Still in use under you, or legacy from the Althoff and Nelson era?\n\n**30. Intern curriculum.** Has the 16-week Intern Sport Science Curriculum from the Development Plan been built and piloted? If so, what changed from the Clemson-based outline?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1976,"cache_read_input_tokens":176356,"output_tokens":876,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":121},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1976,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":876,"cache_read_input_tokens":176356,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1976,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1976},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfWEzr3rGfJc6AYgH6RYb","type":"assistant","uuid":"f9d198af-dad6-4d9f-8f53-d3bb512dc3d5","timestamp":"2026-09-28T17:36:21.254Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\Flint\\.claude\\worktrees\\step1-triage","sessionId":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"step1-triage"}
