red-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tr551YYoFPCB1DSy2iUtz5, add\n\n## Project Rules\n.claude/CLAUDE.md, DEV/CLAUDE.md, config/roots.json, docs/interview-prep.md\n\n## Subagent Tasks\n- [completed] READ-ONLY investigation. Do not run, start, or modify anything except reading files and listing directori...\n\n## Skills Used\ninterview-me\n\n## Environment\ncwd: /c/Users/eric_rash/Desktop/DEV/TypeSafe_Sandbox/.claude/worktrees/drive-triage-run\nmodel:claude-opus-5-5[1m]\nentered worktree: unnamed\nentered worktree: unnamed\n\n## Data References\n- interrupted:false rcInterp:No matches found stderrBytes:0\n- interrupted:false stderrBytes:0\n- interrupted:false stderrBytes:0\n- interrupted:false stderrBytes:0\n- 2a. Percent change from baseline or a rolling average, weve used standard deviations and SWC to diagnois signal vs noise. \n4a. \"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\… (2084 bytes — query mcp__plugin_context-mode_context-mode__ctx_search(source: \"session-events\"))\n- interrupted:false stderrBytes:0\n- 14. Yes in football, you want to peak every Saturday but definitely throughout the month of November as you get closer to postseason, bowl eligibil… (1719 bytes — query mcp__plugin_context-mode_context-mode__ctx_search(source: \"session-events\"))\n- interrupted:false stderrBytes:0\n- … 12 older captures kept in the sandbox — query mcp__plugin_context-mode_context-mode__ctx_search(source: \"session-events\").\n\n## Session Intent\ninvestigate\n\n</session_guide>\n<session_search>\nDetailed session data is indexed in context-mode FTS5 (source: \"session-events\").\nUse mcp__plugin_context-mode_context-mode__ctx_search(queries: [...], source: \"session-events\") when you need specifics.\nDo NOT call ctx_index() — data is already indexed.\n</session_search>\n</session_knowledge>\n</system-reminder>"}],"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\Flin