{"parentUuid":"5e84162b-fb8e-4149-afcc-7fc9c651f1fa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWUpbkEcrBwr1UZEhy3e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":278872,"output_tokens":1633,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":527},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1633,"cache_read_input_tokens":278872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfWUpaiigVYCvcdVoJR29","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"b1a19a32-1a0a-4ed4-afa6-8ac2d420aa98","timestamp":"2026-09-28T20:37:41.487Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV","sessionId":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","version":"2.1.283","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"b1a19a32-1a0a-4ed4-afa6-8ac2d420aa98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWUpbkEcrBwr1UZEhy3e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Closeout: 2026-09-28\n\n**Committed and pushed:**\n- `Flint` (`step1-triage`, `5dc534c`): interview answers, baseline and peaking rev 3, RTP notes, primer, evening handoff.\n- `TypeSafe_Sandbox` (`worktree-drive-triage-run`, `d570609`): pilot write-up, Codex 200/200, draft PR #31.\n- `dotclaude` (`82df4b1`): session logs and the memsearch memory note. I left out two folders of headless-run transcripts, 786 files and 234 MB. One of them holds Drive document text, the same text TypeSafe keeps out of git.\n- `global-memory` (`7adcb2d`): working memory, today's transcript, dev-docs harvest.\n- Every other DEV repo was already clean.\n\n**STATUS.md:** updated in Flint and TypeSafe.\n\n**Memory:** today's transcript is there and the harvest covered 144 repos. `.errors.log` shows 35 memsearch timeouts in a row; that's the known backlog, and the drain tonight is the fix.\n\n**Handoff:** `DEV\\Flint\\.claude\\worktrees\\step1-triage\\docs\\handoffs\\2026-09-28-flint-day3-evening.md`. It covers both repos: resume from there in the morning.\n\n**Still open (yours, tomorrow):**\n1. Approve the shortlists (`docs/shortlists/README.md`). The Drive catalog re-run waits on this.\n2. The Jev audit: A/B/N on 20 rows in `audit_sheet.md`.\n3. Read the primer and answer its 3 questions.\n4. CVASPS: listen through the 47 flagged timestamps.\n\nClear to sign off.\n\n---\n\n### Tonight's memsearch drain: starts 5:30 PM, runs about 14 hours\n\n**Before you leave:**\n1. Keep the laptop **plugged in** and the **lid open**.\n2. **Lock** it with Win+L. Don't sign out or restart: the task only runs while you're signed in.\n3. Optional extra insurance. Open PowerShell, paste this, and leave the window open:\n\n```powershell\nAdd-Type -Namespace W -Name P -MemberDefinition '[DllImport(\"kernel32.dll\")] public static extern uint SetThreadExecutionState(uint f);'\n[W.P]::SetThreadExecutionState(0x80000001) | Out-Null\nWrite-Host \"Keeping the PC awake. Close this window to stop.\"; while ($true) { Start-Sleep 600 }\n```\n\nYour plugged-in sleep timer is already set to \"never\", so that part is covered. To also stop sleep when the lid closes, run this. Baylor's policy may block it, and that's fine; just keep the lid open:\n\n```powershell\npowercfg /setacvalueindex SCHEME_CURRENT SUB_BUTTONS LIDACTION 0; powercfg /setactive SCHEME_CURRENT\n```\n\n**Tomorrow morning, to check that it worked:**\n\n```powershell\nGet-Content $HOME\\.claude\\scripts\\logs\\memsearch-drain.log -Tail 3\n```\n\nYou want to see a line ending in `exit=0`. If it isn't there, send me the output and I'll pick it up from there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":278872,"output_tokens":1633,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":527},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1633,"cache_read_input_tokens":278872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfWUpaiigVYCvcdVoJR29","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"1fd17a17-3017-442d-97a2-87cedf8bf7ec","timestamp":"2026-09-28T20:37:43.253Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e054b45d-33cd-4562-af51-7c3370696c58","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\